cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these test sets, please cite them as below, together with the source corpus (BRUK)."
type: dataset
title: "UkrPunct-BRUK: a test set for Ukrainian punctuation and capitalization restoration"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-12
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23317680
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rseliukh/ukrpunct"
url: "https://github.com/rseliukh/ukrpunct"
abstract: >-
  Test sets and an evaluation script for automatic punctuation and
  capitalization restoration in Ukrainian text, derived from the Brown Corpus
  of Ukrainian (BRUK). Track A: classes O, COMMA, PERIOD, QUESTION plus
  capitalization; four sets with window (up to 200 words of whole sentences)
  and single-sentence segmentation. The evaluation code is under the MIT license.
keywords:
  - Ukrainian
  - punctuation restoration
  - capitalization restoration
  - benchmark
  - BRUK
